"changed_parameters":[{"name":"kraken2_ref_taxonomy","value":"greengenes"},{"name":"skip_dada_taxonomy","value":"true"}],
"rationale":"Setting --skip_dada_taxonomy drops the DADA2 reference formatting, cutting, assignTaxonomy and addSpecies steps, and --kraken2_ref_taxonomy greengenes (a valid key, shipped as a .tgz) adds UNTAR, KRAKEN2 and its result formatting. The QIIME2 downstream branch then imports Kraken2 instead of DADA2 taxonomy, so taxonomy filtering, exports, barplots, diversity, ANCOM-BC/ANCOM-BC2, the R objects, the MultiQC versions and the summary report all re-run. Barrnap, decontam, filters, annotations, the summary tables (Kraken2 is excluded there, the QIIME2 table is unchanged) and the QIIME2 classifier stay cached."}
